# Core (always applied)

See `AGENTS.md` — the single source of truth. This rule is the Cursor delta.

- Stack: Node 24, `yarn@1.22.22` (never npm/pnpm/bun), Next 16.3.6 App Router,
  React 19.2, TS 5.9 strict, Tailwind 4.1, zod, Vitest 3. Alias `@/*` → `src/*`.
- Server Components by default; mutations only via
  `src/actions/*Actions.ts` → `src/services/`.
- Never edit generated `src/shopify/storefront/index.ts` /
  `src/shopify/admin/index.ts`. Never read `.env*.local`.
- No `any`, `import type` inline, handle `T | undefined` from indexing.
- Links/redirects must satisfy `Route` (`typedRoutes`): config literals,
  `` `/collections/${string}` `` templates, `withQuery()` for query strings,
  `normalizeMenuHref()` for CMS urls — never scatter `as Route`.
- Sanitize store HTML via `@/utils/sanitize`; cookies only in `proxy.ts` /
  route handlers / server actions; errors via `reportError`, never `console.*`.
- Verify: `yarn lint`, `yarn typegen && yarn lint-ts`,
  `yarn vitest run <path>`, `yarn test:coverage`.
